#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:10
msgid "🎮 Welcome to JOb Exit! 🎮"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:13
msgid "🤔 What is JOb Exit?"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:14
msgid "JOb Exit is the most fun office game ever! Imagine Tinder, but instead of looking for your soulmate, you decide which colleagues might soon leave the company (with a touch of irony, of course)!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:15
msgid "This game was created in a playful spirit and is not meant to be offensive to anyone. It's just a way to lighten up the workday, create a moment of fun, and maybe win the competition for the best \"reverse talent scout\" in the office!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:19
msgid "🎯 Game Objective"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:20
msgid "The objective is simple: guess which colleagues might soon leave the company. The better you are at predicting who will \"exit\", the more points you'll earn! Become the best \"reverse talent hunter\" and conquer the top of the global leaderboard!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:24
msgid "🎮 How to Play?"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:26
msgid "Swipe right (or press EXIT)"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:26
msgid "If you think the colleague will soon \"exit\". This adds a point to their exit score and earns you experience points if you guess correctly!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:27
msgid "Swipe left (or press NOPE)"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:27
msgid "If you think the colleague will stay with the company. This doesn't affect the score."
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:28
msgid "Each card shows the colleague's photo, name, company code, and years of service."
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:29
msgid "The more exit points you assign to a colleague, the higher your final score will be if they end up in \"exit\"!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:34
msgid "⏱️ Cooldown System"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:35
msgid "After voting for all available employees, you'll need to wait 8 hours before you can vote again. You'll see a timer showing you how much time is left. Don't worry, time flies when you're having fun!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:39
msgid "📊 Game Screens"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:41
msgid "Home"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:41
msgid "Here you can vote for your colleagues with swipe. Have fun giving EXIT or NOPE!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:42
msgid "Exit Points"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:42
msgid "Shows employees sorted by exit score. Who will be the next to leave the company?"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:43
msgid "Exit"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:43
msgid "The hall of fame (or hall of shame?) of colleagues who have reached \"exited\" status. Here you can see when they left and their final score."
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:44
msgid "Global Leaderboard"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:44
msgid "The ranking of players who are best at predicting exits! Climb the ranks and become the best reverse talent scout!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:45
msgid "Account"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:45
msgid "Manage your profile, see your experience points and the employees you've voted for."
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:50
msgid "💰 Scoring System"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:51
msgid "In JOb Exit there are two types of scores:"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:53
msgid "Exit Points"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:53
msgid "These are the points you assign to employees when you vote EXIT. The more exit points an employee has, the higher the experience score you'll get."
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:54
msgid "Experience Points (EXP)"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:54
msgid "These are your personal points that you earn when an employee you voted for ends up in the Exit screen. The calculation is: employee's years of service + total exit points received * exit points assigned by the user = experience points earned!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:56
msgid "Your total experience points determine your position in the Global Leaderboard. The more you have, the higher you'll be in the rankings!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:60
msgid "🎭 Ironic Comments"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:61
msgid "Every time you vote, a random ironic comment will appear. Some are funny, others sarcastic, but all are designed to make you smile! The comments are different depending on whether you voted EXIT or NOPE."
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:65
msgid "⚠️ Important Disclaimer"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:66
msgid "JOb Exit is a purely playful game and has no impact on the actual employment situation of employees. Exit predictions are just for fun and do not reflect in any way the real intentions or situations of colleagues."
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:67
msgid "Always remember to play with respect and good humor. The goal is to have fun together, not to offend anyone!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:71
msgid "🚀 Ready to Play?"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:72
msgid "Now that you know all the rules, it's time to go back to the home screen and start voting! Who will be the next to EXIT? It's up to you to decide!"
msgstr ""

#: public/partials/job-exit-info.php:73
msgid "Have fun and may the best reverse talent scout win! 🏆"
msgstr ""

